# real-room-interop: server arguments for citra-room.exe (network_version 4).
# Consumed by: real_room_interop.exe real -Protocol v4 -RoomArgsFile config/citra-room.args
# citra-room has no bind option either (help text citra-room.cpp:44-62), so it also listens
# on 0.0.0.0 and needs -AllowWildcardBind. --token/--web-api-url are never passed, which is
# what keeps the room private ("Hosting a private room") and guarantees no external contact.
* = --room-name {room} --room-description real-room-interop --preferred-game RealRoomInterop --port {port} --max_members {slots} --password {password}
